      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft knit tee fabric based on the supplied photos; no exact fiber content was available from the blocked vendor page.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A playful matching raglan tee for parents and kids, made for casual family photos, vacation walks, birthdays, and everyday twinning.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Blue Apricot Letter pairs an apricot body with navy sleeves, a red crew neckline, and sweet letter-and-heart graphics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Short raglan sleeves, contrast neck trim, relaxed tee shape, adult letter graphics, and a child heart graphic. The denim shorts and pants shown in the photos are styling only and not included.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, turn inside out, line dry or tumble low, and avoid bleach. This care line is a conservative inference because the blocked vendor page did not expose wash instructions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Children 2Y through 9-10Y and adults S through 5XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n      <th>Sleeve / Skirt (cm)</th>\n      <th>Pant / Short (cm)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>10-12.5</td>\n<td>85-95</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>40</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>12.5-15</td>\n<td>90-105</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>11.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>15-17.5</td>\n<td>105-115</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>44</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>17.5-22.5</td>\n<td>115-125</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>12.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>46</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>22.5-27.5</td>\n<td>125-135</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27.5-32.5</td>\n<td>135-145</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>13.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>53</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32.5-37.5</td>\n<td>145-155</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>56</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult S</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>45-52.5</td>\n<td>160-165</td>\n<td>92</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>92</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>61</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>52.5-57.5</td>\n<td>165-170</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>96</td>\n<td>84</td>\n<td>64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>57.5-65</td>\n<td>170-175</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>20.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>65-72.5</td>\n<td>175-180</td>\n<td>106</td>\n<td>20.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>106</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>69</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>72.5-80</td>\n<td>180-185</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>80-90</td>\n<td>185-190</td>\n<td>116</td>\n<td>21.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>116</td>\n<td>104</td>\n<td>73</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 4XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>90-100</td>\n<td>190-195</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>108</td>\n<td>75</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 5XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>100-110</td>\n<td>195-200</td>\n<td>124</td>\n<td>22.5</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>124</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>77</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Blue Apricot Letter keeps matching family style easy and bright with one relaxed tee silhouette across kids and adults. The navy raglan sleeves, apricot body, and red neckline make the set feel coordinated without being too formal, while the letter-and-heart artwork gives each family member a playful photo-ready detail.</p>\n\n<p>The attached chart publishes top measurements for child sizes 90-150 and adult sizes S-5XL. The two infant rows labeled as rompers were excluded from this Tops listing, and the denim bottoms in the images are styling only. The published variants therefore stay tightly tied to the vendor-backed top rows.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Coordinated raglan tee:</strong> Matching short-sleeve top for kids and adults in the same apricot, navy, and red palette.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family-friendly graphics:</strong> Adult shirts carry letter artwork while the child top has a bold heart graphic for a sweet matching moment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy warm-weather styling:</strong> The relaxed tee shape pairs naturally with denim shorts, jeans, skirts, or casual vacation outfits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Wide adult size range:</strong> Adult sizing runs from S through 5XL based on the attached chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Honest single-garment scope:</strong> This listing covers the tops only; shorts, jeans, hats, and accessories are not included.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need and build a casual matching family tee look for photos, trips, and everyday plans together.</p>",
